{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "04ZV", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\section{", "suffix": "}\n\\label{section-monomorphisms}"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:1564c69d16756f8795725c25bfd8cabb32c78b1a420d813e70c29821a2963895", "source_text": "Monomorphisms of algebraic stacks", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6e04aab31a33731bbf161c8248fd6c4c0db193392b55e5d5816f010ca0666469", "unit_id": "tag:04ZV:title"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "04ZV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$2$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-monomorphism}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:b15315ec3c2fa7b154c0d17c24b63d47f12b572ea3fa602a460510e1a685b882", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:554ecec98a681444f245cb3927f2f9421164f02e944d1d291a8606b23e57a17d", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nWe define a monomorphism of algebraic stacks in the following way.\nWe will see in\nLemma <REF_0001>\nthat this is compatible with the corresponding <MATH_0001>-category theoretic notion.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c2ffe8db5b38d42794cbf5f60f90079b4aa7352ddf907cf11af0052d479bbb2b", "unit_id": "tag:04ZV:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "04ZV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{section-properties-morphisms}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-monomorphism}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:61cc0205166d1e4e4ba3829d6e96c197bf8db5e865bf4d364df19688c7685baa", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e04a23155f9e8f28944ed2cc46b160ce300a0548a7fa647e48da1de899101399", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nWe say <MATH_0002> is a <TEXTITOPEN_0001>monomorphism<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>\nif it is representable by algebraic spaces and a monomorphism in the sense of\nSection <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3fbc7d9f425783af6d1b0a12a5c6118a99f7569a7620a954bed81f5388c22aa3", "unit_id": "tag:04ZW:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "04ZV", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:733f7ec6c6dbc5cde60ef2415c2b09afe92d5475b6eb24582d707db3e59b9978", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nFirst some basic lemmas.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d72239b87b9642183236a88bf7818461334a230fbe96c5b7d46862418467006a", "unit_id": "tag:04ZV:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04ZV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{X}$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-monomorphism}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:7a7cf25a2fc50f8d8ad17c552b076ee86b97b5f0d2d2b7155de6c7482cb00c00", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a1a9034ce9ed8f3ba7cedea105c58db396bed9f1b0283cc79f87e22c361510d6", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a monomorphism.\nThen <MATH_0003>\nis a monomorphism.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:381c198bd8469ecfe0a78a7214c758e888ec11dc86cee62b9fde162cd2a3b6f2", "unit_id": "tag:04ZX:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04ZV", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{section-properties-morphisms}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:cec3b3ae2a55b55cc8f8d656bdbfe5582cc8ba9c1440ba425b32b72a312542fa", "source_text": "This follows from the general discussion in\nSection <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d668f41f0ac978d34c17ad6dd649034d78b29e73ee93446da7d3ce9097aeb7f6", "unit_id": "tag:04ZX:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04ZV", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-composition-monomorphism}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:58b38c3a3c843cc1407f1eb4de7a0de90a7c8839d58d88a06ed4e1480b49b29b", "source_text": "Compositions of monomorphisms of algebraic stacks are monomorphisms.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ac2acd81172c7abba8caba57b58ce1dab8bfef3de8ac8573c6275fc0ae58f140", "unit_id": "tag:04ZY:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04ZV", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{section-properties-morphisms}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{spaces-morphisms-lemma-composition-monomorphism}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b47587a619cda6e98807683c83e206b2dce66f5295244569212b8a296a2728b2", "source_text": "This follows from the general discussion in\nSection <REF_0001>\nand\nMorphisms of Spaces,\nLemma <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0bfd067cf501ac04cacf1d675cfd31113b3868907f7f9646c2e6ca1c0f106a15", "unit_id": "tag:04ZY:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04ZV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$f$", "MATH_0004": "$\\Delta_f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{X} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0005": "$W$", "MATH_0006": "$W \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0007": "$V = \\mathcal{X} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} W$", "MATH_0008": "$V \\to W$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\item", "STRUCT_0006": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-monomorphism}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:ef43b14c89cc77ed29fe8be3ea0ae6b552890ce6e3018db385da79c485b74918", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:152807aca2e3b0b7102fecf006fc2afc8211189d479c6fd0950bd0bdf2396c91", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nThe following are equivalent:\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0002> is a monomorphism,\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0003> is fully faithful,\n<STRUCT_0004> the diagonal\n<MATH_0004>\nis an equivalence, and\n<STRUCT_0005> there exists an algebraic space <MATH_0005> and a surjective, flat morphism\n<MATH_0006> which is locally of finite presentation such that\n<MATH_0007> is an algebraic space, and the\nmorphism <MATH_0008> is a monomorphism of algebraic spaces.\n<STRUCT_0006>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:508ef6ce8d37e56f71acdd7ca2553d573c7a6b4892a74873073d2ac36bbdf4ba", "unit_id": "tag:04ZZ:statement"}
